  "description": "Max Verstappen raced in Formula One before he had a road license.\n\nSources:\n- Wikipedia: Max Verstappen: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Max_Verstappen\n- Wikipedia: 2016 Spanish Grand Prix: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2016_Spanish_Grand_Prix\n\nFrom the cited pages: he competed in Formula One for over a season before getting a road driving licence on his 18th birthday; at the 2015 Australian Grand Prix he became the youngest driver in Formula One history, aged 17 years and 166 days; at the 2016 Spanish Grand Prix, in his first race for Red Bull Racing, he became the youngest ever winner at 18 years and 228 days; in 2021 he overtook Lewis Hamilton on the final lap of the last race to win his first title; he won four consecutive titles, 2021 to 2024. Not financial advice.\n\n#shorts #verstappen #f1 #howtheymakemoney",
